(7814423, 1305582, 12200, '<td valign="top">
I loved this one. It must have taken some studied precision to so accurately recreate not only the look but also the mood and aura of the original. It also exhibits the thing that most impresses me in your portfolio: human subject control. You have some kind of black magic when it comes to capturing people in ways that are obviously posed yet don''t feel even the least bit inauthentic. It''s inspiring.</td>', 'I loved this one. It must have taken some studied precision to so accurately recreate not only the look but also the mood and aura of the original. It also exhibits the thing that most impresses me in your portfolio: human subject control. You have some kind of black magic when it comes to capturing people in ways that are obviously posed yet don''t feel even the least bit inauthentic. It''s inspiring.', '2026-04-10 07:44:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(7814424, 1305394, 12200, '<td valign="top">
You really captured the b-movie horror vibe with this composition, Roz. I never would have guessed that was your grandson''s face! But you definitely got that Hitchcockian VERTIGO expression exactly right. And all your processing and compositing choices are just really nicely handled.</td>', 'You really captured the b-movie horror vibe with this composition, Roz. I never would have guessed that was your grandson''s face! But you definitely got that Hitchcockian VERTIGO expression exactly right. And all your processing and compositing choices are just really nicely handled.', '2026-04-10 07:51:09.000000', NULL, 0),
