(7814426, 1305220, 12200, '<td valign="top">
Thought for sure this would be in the top three. This is visual satire at its finest. I''m not sure I followed all of what you were saying about your cloning and body-swapping stuff, but whatever you did sure works just great in the final product. I never would have imagined this to be anything but a well-dressed, semi-mythical character.
<br/>
<br/>On a sidenote, having read your notes, I''m now feeling inclined to also point out how impressed I am with your handling of the white space. How in the world, if this was shot outdoors, did you manage to get such a convincing grey-on-white shadow down there???</td>', 'Thought for sure this would be in the top three. This is visual satire at its finest. I''m not sure I followed all of what you were saying about your cloning and body-swapping stuff, but whatever you did sure works just great in the final product. I never would have imagined this to be anything but a well-dressed, semi-mythical character.

On a sidenote, having read your notes, I''m now feeling inclined to also point out how impressed I am with your handling of the white space. How in the world, if this was shot outdoors, did you manage to get such a convincing grey-on-white shadow down there???', '2026-04-10 07:59:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(7814427, 1305557, 12200, '<td valign="top">
